        {
          "text": "[^pmc3809311]: PMC. \"Identification of technical item flaws leads to improvement of MCQ quality\" (PMC3809311). https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3809311/ - Two-category flaw taxonomy; longitudinal flaw-rate reduction (67% → 21%).",
